# P12 round 5: Patch Vary on the Mini. Instr held + Up x3 picks Synth 1 (no pads on the Mini), Menu box 1 (Instrument Parameters), F8 opens
# the patch editor. The Mini has no encoder and its Shift + Plus is the master volume: F4 held + Plus1 x2 moves the amount from 10 % to 20 %
# (the label's second line, the trace reads it) and that release does not vary, a tap of F4 then varies (popup "Vary 20%", on release), Shift + F4 takes it back
# ("Vary undone"). plus_flows.sh reads the part afterwards (UISHOT_TRACE_VARY): the amount reaches 20, the values move away and come back.
# Replay: plus_flows.sh mini
title: Patch Vary on the Mini (P12)
check: texts
pause: 90ms

wait 1500ms
press Instr
wait 400ms
tap Up x3
wait 300ms
release Instr
wait 600ms
press Menu
wait 400ms
tap Right
wait 300ms
release Menu
wait 1200ms
tap F8
wait 1500ms
expect text "Edit Patch"
expect text "Vary"
press F4
wait 300ms
tap Plus1
wait 300ms
tap Plus1
wait 300ms
release F4
wait 600ms
tap F4
wait 600ms
expect text "Vary 20%"
shot vary
wait 1500ms
press Shift
wait 300ms
tap F4
wait 300ms
release Shift
wait 600ms
expect text "Vary undone"
